%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5b11a58205ec3474ca216360e9fa74a8, type: 3}
  m_Name: Text Shared Data
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_TableCollectionName: Text
  m_TableCollectionNameGuidString: 0942d88cecd938a4389643f525586ed3
  m_Entries:
  - m_Id: 98056589312
    m_Key: Play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 145863266304
    m_Key: Settings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 195792261120
    m_Key: Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1885044002816
    m_Key: Exit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3515051200512
    m_Key: Credits info
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4156028932096
    m_Key: Back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4317257977856
    m_Key: Localization
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4451538620416
    m_Key: Skip tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14226020159488
    m_Key: I lost my kitchen keys.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14319691550720
    m_Key: Now I have to cook in the cauldron.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14420891717632
    m_Key: It's life-threatening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14533500391424
    m_Key: I wanted to enclose each room with its own door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14682314297344
    m_Key: But when installing the lever on this door, the lever broke.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14777474666496
    m_Key: I just came from there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14822445993984
    m_Key: It's a dead end that way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 14962154065920
    m_Key: And only a field of golden flowers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15175547670528
    m_Key: There used to be a staircase here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15287908880384
    m_Key: But the floor was more important to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15353096753152
    m_Key: The basement collapsed anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18997590413312
    m_Key: "Wow, you actually did it! Alright, let\u2019s see\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19115190308864
    m_Key: "\u2026Are you serious? This was supposed to work?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19214108774400
    m_Key: "Oh, of course! Maybe if we water it down a little more, it\u2019ll be
      completely useless!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19376923267072
    m_Key: "Eh, whatever\u2026 Mistakes should be corrected <color=black>immediately</color>."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20760766763008
    m_Key: Hey, kid. You out here all alone, or am I just seeing things?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20884641337344
    m_Key: "Then again\u2026 who\u2019d you even expect to keep you company? That
      scrawny rat over there?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20968762298368
    m_Key: "Heh\u2026 though, who knows, maybe it\u2019s brewing potions too."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21044993773568
    m_Key: "So, word is - you\u2019re not much of a cook, but you sure know how to
      poison."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21147838107648
    m_Key: "That\u2019s good. I like people who know how to impress guests right
      away."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21213034369024
    m_Key: "But tell me honestly - are you sure you know what you\u2019re doing?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21266385915904
    m_Key: Or are you just tossing stuff in until something explodes?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21321780088832
    m_Key: "Alright, alright, don\u2019t get mad. It\u2019s simple. You\u2019ve got
      recipes. Two, to be exact. One\u2019s weak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21461035175936
    m_Key: "The other\u2026 well, let\u2019s just say it doesn\u2019t leave many
      witnesses."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21552802353152
    m_Key: It all starts with a <color=yellow>golden</color> flower.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21711212826624
    m_Key: The order matters. <color=red>Red</color>, <color=purple>purple</color>,
      <color=green>green</color>, <color=green>green</color> - it all has meaning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22213619142656
    m_Key: "But here\u2019s the fun part\u2026 if you mess up\u2026 heh-heh\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22271290822656
    m_Key: "You\u2019ll be the first to taste your own brew."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22362558877696
    m_Key: "And trust me, that\u2019s not a compliment to the chef."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22450073030656
    m_Key: "Now, be a good little witch and whip me up something\u2026 classic. Just
      a regular poison."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22573486231552
    m_Key: "No surprises, alright? I\u2019ve got plans tonight."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23873179406336
    m_Key: "Heh-heh\u2026 well, would you look at that. You actually pulled it off."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23952330117120
    m_Key: "And here I was, thinking I\u2019d have to gather the ingredients myself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24012199612416
    m_Key: "And y\u2019know\u2026 I wasn\u2019t really in the mood."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24067086274560
    m_Key: "Gotta say, it smells\u2026 hmm\u2026 promising. Not too sharp, not too
      weak. Just right."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24130269270016
    m_Key: "I see you know how to listen. That\u2019s a rare skill, y\u2019know."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24181741768704
    m_Key: "So tell me\u2026 how does it feel? Making poison? Knowing that every
      drop is someone\u2019s last breath?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24284699348992
    m_Key: "That with just a flick of your finger\u2026 you could decide someone
      else\u2019s fate?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24356174483456
    m_Key: "\u2026Eh, don\u2019t think too hard about it. I\u2019m just messing with
      ya. Really."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24413938438144
    m_Key: "Either way, you did good. This was\u2026 interesting. Maybe I\u2019ll
      drop by again sometime."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24478832709632
    m_Key: "Or maybe\u2026 you\u2019ll wish I hadn\u2019t."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28612554182656
    m_Key: HEY, YOU!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28690794729472
    m_Key: THINK YOU CAN JUST WALTZ IN HERE AND BREW THE STRONGEST POISON?! HA!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28807895502848
    m_Key: "THIS ISN\u2019T JUST A BREW - THIS IS A TRIAL!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 28916595085312
    m_Key: ONLY THOSE WHO CAN STAND THE HEAT DESERVE TO COMMAND THIS POWER!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29206673149952
    m_Key: "LISTEN CLOSELY! YOU CAN\u2019T JUST THROW INGREDIENTS AROUND LIKE SOME
      FOOLISH GOBLIN!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29277070348288
    m_Key: NO! YOU HAVE TO BE PRECISE! STRATEGIC!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29426349821952
    m_Key: VICTORY ONLY BELONGS TO THOSE WHO FOLLOW THE RIGHT PLAN!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29490887577600
    m_Key: <color=purple>PURPLE</color>, <color=red>RED</color>, <color=red>RED</color>,
      <color=purple>PURPLE</color>, <color=green>GREEN</color>!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29768013631488
    m_Key: "IF YOU DO EVERYTHING RIGHT - YOU\u2019LL CREATE THE STRONGEST POISON,
      CAPABLE OF BRINGING DOWN ANYONE!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29875933073408
    m_Key: "BUT IF YOU MESS UP\u2026 YOU\u2019LL BE ITS FIRST VICTIM!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29970845978624
    m_Key: "NOW GO! SHOW ME YOU\u2019RE NOT SOME WEAKLING! BREW THAT POISON!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30641087369216
    m_Key: "HAHAHAHA! NOW THAT\u2019S WHAT I\u2019M TALKING ABOUT!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30895539015680
    m_Key: YOU DID IT! A TRUE, POWERFUL, UNSTOPPABLE POISON!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30975570530304
    m_Key: "THIS IS LIKE A TRUE BATTLE ELIXIR! IF THIS FALLS INTO THE WRONG HANDS\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31037621063680
    m_Key: "HA, WHO AM I KIDDING?! THEY WON\u2019T SURVIVE!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31095624093696
    m_Key: "YOU\u2019RE DOING GREAT. BUT REMEMBER - THIS ISN\u2019T A GAME!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31194479644672
    m_Key: "THE POWER YOU CREATE - IT\u2019S A RESPONSIBILITY! DON\u2019T LET IT
      GO TO WASTE!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31275182247936
    m_Key: GOOD JOB. IF I EVER NEED MORE POISON - NOW I KNOW WHO TO CALL!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60309949698048
    m_Key: "A poison, huh? Hm. I\u2019ve had worse contracts. But if it's needed,
      someone must\u2019ve earned it. Brew it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60360881131520
    m_Key: "I need something\u2026 discreet. Something that does its job before anyone
      even realizes. Can you handle that?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60423141380096
    m_Key: "Oh, poison! What a\u2026 sophisticated tool. Why get our hands dirty
      when we can resolve things elegantly, right?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60488572522496
    m_Key: "Death by poison is checkmate without noise or blood. The enemy won\u2019t
      realize their loss until it\u2019s too late. Ready?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60597922222080
    m_Key: "In this world, only the fastest survive. Give me poison, and I\u2019ll
      make sure no one even has time to blink."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60663625994240
    m_Key: Some things are better done quietly. Can you handle it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60731368198144
    m_Key: "You know, sometimes it\u2019s easier to get rid of someone without all
      the noise. You know how to make that happen?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60780391223296
    m_Key: I prefer silent methods. Will your poison do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60835495989248
    m_Key: "Hey, I need somethin\u2019\u2026 y\u2019know, that does the job without
      all the noise. Got it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 60889011113984
    m_Key: The weak do not deserve power. Give me poison, and I will cleanse the
      world of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61524599164928
    m_Key: Strong. Pure. No unnecessary additives. If they die quickly, you did well.
      Stay safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61594295914496
    m_Key: "Excellent work, a Phantom Thief would approve. Now\u2026 I vanish as
      silently as I came."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61644321378304
    m_Key: "You exceeded my expectations! This\u2026 is perfect. Maybe next time,
      you\u2019ll make something even more exquisite?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61724281589760
    m_Key: "Magnificent. You created a tool that ends everything in one move. Now\u2026
      the game is over."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61782959902720
    m_Key: "Precise. Clean. Just as it should be. You\u2019ve impressed me, gunslinger."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61836823154688
    m_Key: You just made the right decision for the whole galaxy. Good work, soldier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61885745516544
    m_Key: Simple. Effective. No witnesses. Just the way I like it. You did good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61945875058688
    m_Key: Target eliminated. Excellent work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 61994864529408
    m_Key: Man, this is sick! You really know your stuff!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62042008506368
    m_Key: A painless death. Elegant. You exceeded my expectations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62567538020352
    m_Key: "\u2026Do you feel it? The stench of weakness clings to this world. It
      has been consumed by cowardice and false hope. Fix it. Give me a poison that
      will reduce them to dust."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62612840697856
    m_Key: "Humanity\u2026 so pitiful in its weakness. I need a poison that will
      wake them from their illusions. One that will show only the strong deserve
      to live. Can you handle it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62665416298496
    m_Key: "Sins must be punished\u2026 pain is not enough. Bring me a poison to
      cleanse their souls\u2026 permanently."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62708730875904
    m_Key: Power is everything. Give me a poison that will show fate belongs only
      to those strong enough to take it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62756545941504
    m_Key: "Do you feel the chill? It is the call\u2026 the call of eternity. Give
      me a poison that will show them death is only the beginning."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62865727868928
    m_Key: This world is rotting. People cling to their meaningless lives. I need
      a poison to free them from this illusion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62920790691840
    m_Key: "Tell me\u2026 do you know what insanity is? It's doing the same thing
      over and over and expecting different results. I need a poison that will change
      their reality\u2026 permanently."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62974217736192
    m_Key: At night, the world belongs to me. But there are those who dare to resist.
      Bring me a poison that will make them bow their heads.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63042329038848
    m_Key: "The weak deserve only one thing\u2014destruction. Give me a poison to
      prove that only the strong survive."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63090538369024
    m_Key: Progress demands sacrifice. Give me a poison that will clear the path
      to perfection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63705670799360
    m_Key: "Hmm\u2026 This poison\u2026 It carries pure destruction. Good work. The
      world will burn clean."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63744229036032
    m_Key: "Perfect. This\u2026 is a new dawn. Evolution is coming, and it will not
      spare the weak."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63794619404288
    m_Key: "Now\u2026 they understand. Be cleansed\u2026 or perish."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63883001778176
    m_Key: "Hmph\u2026 As it should be. Weakness must be purged."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 63935208280064
    m_Key: "Excellent\u2026 They will join my ranks. The time has come."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64031912153088
    m_Key: "Hah\u2026 the cleansing hour has come. All life will bow to my will."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64089462198272
    m_Key: "HAHA! Now that\u2019s what I\u2019m talking about! They\u2019ll finally
      know what true chaos is!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64136937525248
    m_Key: "Hah\u2026 Now the night is mine once more. Excellent work."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64251119063040
    m_Key: HAHA! I approve. You have proven your worth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 64312435593216
    m_Key: "Excellent\u2026 This poison is a step toward a greater future."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_KeyGenerator:
    rid: 54141200453075206
